              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Moabu inyeesa gaweay nea ghabwatgeat ghamwaash aseeta nyaawa aba uhuuda giijeeda ak iissa iiwea headaanyi ghaydit ghamwaash aseeta, ea maygwajooriischi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
