          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Aba jeedeaba gweanyeew samwagu gawuurji gweanyeeka siida gadiyeeda, abeeda miyeenooda Moabu gaygoosha, earapeadi fugaaschi saang'a, boosteanga gajea ng'ay muuchi ak ea maygwanda uurjeenga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
